content:
Under **Northgate Store and Online Orders**, the late-change goodwill refund on a Northgate Scheduled Large-Item Delivery order carries an extra percentage for how recent the fee is, counted in calendar days from the date of the latest late-change fee with an amount above 0.00 to the scheduled date the order carries when the refund is worked out, the fee date left out and the scheduled date included:

- seven days or fewer: adds 25 percent;
- eight to thirty days: adds 10 percent;
- longer: adds nothing.

**Boundary pairs (hypothetical fee dated 1 October).** A scheduled date of 8 October is seven days and adds 25 percent; 9 October is eight days and adds 10 percent; 31 October is thirty days and adds 10 percent; 1 November is thirty-one days and adds nothing.
